  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ea03dd6f-e823-4345-92bf-b556d35bed38",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1424,
        -288
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 688,
        "height": 572,
        "content": "## 🧩 WhatsApp to GoHighLevel Contact Sync\n\n### How it works\nWhen a new WhatsApp message arrives through Wati, this workflow looks up the sender's contact details and recent conversation history, then creates (or updates) a matching contact inside GoHighLevel. The latest incoming message is attached to that contact as a note, so your sales team can read WhatsApp conversations directly from the CRM. Finally, the workflow saves the Wati and GoHighLevel conversation IDs to a Google Sheet, keeping a simple mapping table for future lookups or reporting.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Connect your Wati API credentials to the \"Fetch Contact Details from Wati\" and \"Fetch Recent Wati Messages\" nodes.\n2. Add your GoHighLevel Private Integration Token to the Authorization header in both HTTP Request nodes.\n3. Replace the `locationId` placeholder with your own GoHighLevel sub-account ID.\n4. Connect a Google account and point the sheet node to your own tracking spreadsheet.\n5. Point your Wati webhook to this workflow's URL, then send a test WhatsApp message to confirm it runs end to end."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "040bcd62-1b08-4f26-a519-7059dd2596f1",
      "name": "Section - Trigger & Data Retrieval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -640,
        176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 760,
        "height": 412,
        "content": "## 📩 Trigger & Data Retrieval\nCaptures the incoming WhatsApp webhook from Wati, then pulls the sender's contact profile and their most recent messages so the rest of the workflow has the data it needs."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "603e942f-175f-4bce-88e0-72df8e6c32bd",
      "name": "Section - Sync Contact to GoHighLevel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        176,
        176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 412,
        "content": "## 🔄 Sync Contact to GoHighLevel\nCreates or updates the contact in GoHighLevel using the Wati profile, then logs the latest WhatsApp message as a note on that contact record."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c35a5429-67c2-4019-8c48-dc5590f2bbd4",
      "name": "Section - Log Conversation Mapping",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        736,
        176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 444,
        "height": 412,
        "content": "## 🗂️ Log Conversation Mapping\nAppends the Wati and GoHighLevel conversation IDs to a Google Sheet, giving you a simple audit trail for troubleshooting or reporting later."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "08271164-6583-4448-8875-e9d88b30bc94",
      "name": "Credentials & Security",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
