        "height": 260,
        "content": "## 🔐 Credentials & Security\nUse a GoHighLevel Private Integration Token and OAuth2 for Google Sheets and Wati. Never commit real tokens or location IDs — use placeholders in shared templates."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
